  "title": "Bigos (Hunter's Stew)",
  "description": "This bigos recipe is a traditional Polish stew that combines pork, smoked bacon, kielbasa sausage, and sauerkraut. Perfect for a comforting meal on a cold day!",
  "authors": [
    "MJ46NY"
  ],
